      "claim": "Every line number cited in the Context section is stale at this snapshot (e.g. critic_cell is said to be \"defined at saffron/cell/session.py:1335\" but is actually at 1348; exec_'s default timeout is said to be at \"saffron/cell/runtime.py:470\" but is actually at 491; DEFAULT_HOME is said to be at \"(:74)\" but is actually at 76; _mirror_path is said to be at \"saffron/cli.py:505\" but is actually defined at 1723), because the spec says the numbers were read at bc879e2c, a commit that predates SA-0262, SA-0271 and SA-0285 landing and shifting these files. The spec explicitly discloses this drift and tells the builder to re-read session.py at the tree base, and I verified the substance of every citation (names, signatures, control flow) is still true at this snapshot, so this costs nothing to leave.",
